SUMMARY:2027 European Security Studies Conference
DESCRIPTION:The annual conference of the NetSec community and the European Initiative for Security Studies\, at the University of Belgrade\, Faculty of Political Science. The NetSec Training School runs alongside it\, from 8 to 11 June. The call for papers will be published on eiss-europa.com by early November 2026.\n\nDetails: https://netsec-cost.eu/essc-2027.html
